  "explanation": "Build 1D dynamic array dp from 0 up to target amount. For each amount x, iterate through available coins c to calculate min transition: dp[x] = min(dp[x], 1 + dp[x - c]).",
  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION coinChange(coins, amount):\n    dp = ARRAY_OF_SIZE(amount + 1, INITIAL_VALUE = INFINITY)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    FOR a FROM 1 TO amount DO:\n        FOR c IN coins DO:\n            IF a - c >= 0 THEN dp[a] = MIN(dp[a], 1 + dp[a - c])\n        END FOR\n    END FOR\n    RETURN dp[amount] != INFINITY ? dp[amount] : -1\nEND FUNCTION",
